[en.DECISION_C12_EEL_SURVEY_TEAM]
Send Investigation Team

[en.DECISION_C12_EEL_SURVEY_TEAM_desc]
A scientific expedition composed of professional geologists will delve into the underground and mountainous areas of Rockville and its surrounding regions. They will collect rock samples and attempt to analyze the causes and sources of the earthquakes.

[zh.DECISION_C12_EEL_SURVEY_TEAM]
派遣科考队

[zh.DECISION_C12_EEL_SURVEY_TEAM_desc]
一支由专业地质学家组成的科考队将深入洛克维尔和周边地区的地下和山脉，采集岩石样本并试图分析地震的原因和来源。
